**Designing the** **Network of the Future**

Indus CAD Works LLC is a fiber network design company specializing in the field of telecommunications. We are a design firm that deals in FTTH, FTTX, underground and aerial design. We put our clients' needs first in every project and strive to complete every project with efficiency, quality and integrity. We are a Certified Women Owned Business in the state of Florida.

**Our Services**

**OSP Fiber Design**

We at Indus CAD Works specialize in the use of AutoCAD and GIS based software for Fiber Optics Network Design in FTTH, FTTX, MDU design , underground and aerial plant.

**OSP Engineering**

We do complete OSP Engineering which includes Preliminary Design, Make Ready, Permitting and as-built documentation.

**Network Consulting**

Our network consulting services include Network Architecture Review, Standards Review, Process Documentation, GIS data management, and training.

**Our Clients**

Our Clients include ISPs (Internet Service Providers), Telecommunications companies and Municipalities. Some clients include: Comcast, Verizon, USTelecom, AT&T, Crown Castle, Comcast, AT&T.

